ry":"Use the final weekday window for a student, faculty, or alumni exhibition.","evidence_claim":"The university says its 2,500-square-foot gallery hosts student, faculty, and alumni exhibitions in varied media and is located in the Art and Education Building.","source_url":"https://www.csueastbay.edu/artgallery/","source_title":"University Art Gallery","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Visit only during an open exhibition; the gallery lists Tuesday–Thursday hours and says it is closed Fridays and during academic breaks.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csueb-core-library-collections","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"CORE Library","title":"Browse CORE Beyond the Textbooks","subtitle":"Friday afternoon · CORE building","notes":"Locate the popular reading, graphic-novel, tabletop-game, and technology collections so you know what can support future downtime.","short_summary":"Turn a library orientation stop into a survey of leisure and study resources.","evidence_claim":"The university library lists circulating books, popular reading, graphic novels, tabletop games, course materials, and loanable technology among its Hayward campus collections.","source_url":"https://library.csueastbay.edu/usingthelibraries/collections","source_title":"Using the Libraries: Collections","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Collection access and borrowing eligibility vary; confirm current CORE hours and bring your Bay Card for checkouts.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csueb-university-union","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Cal State East Bay University Union","title":"Get Oriented at the University Union","subtitle":"Friday evening · North and South Univers